 "details": "A Mozart gala in the Rittersaal, the grand baroque hall of Mannheim Palace: soloists of the Musikhochschule Mannheim sing and play Mozart arias (Figaro, Zauberflöte, Mitridate, La finta giardiniera) and concertos (oboe KV 314, horn no. 2, piano \"Jeunehomme\" KV 271) with orchestra under Cornelius Meister. The Mozart-Gesellschaft Kurpfalz awards its Mozart soloist prize 2026 during the evening.\n\nSaturday 19:00, tickets from 25 EUR via Reservix. Facts from the mvp.de listing; not confirmed on an official organiser page.",
